213	    /**
214	     * Whether this owner was flagged a possible (soft) duplicate at creation time: it was not a
215	     * hard duplicate, but its {@code soundex(lastName)} and postcode matched an existing owner's while
216	     * its identity key differed. {@code false} (or {@code null} for owners created before the check)
217	     * when no such match was found.
