241	     * {@code DELETE /api/owners/{id}} endpoint flags it {@code true} while retaining the record, and
242	     * the create endpoint's duplicate and identity checks ignore owners flagged deleted. Treated as
243	     * {@code false} when {@code null} (owners persisted before the column existed).
244	     */
